{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊代表余翠怡於女子A級重劍個人賽，晉身四強，肯定再為港隊奪得獎牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n余翠怡16強面對日本劍手松本美惠子，中段一度落後4:8，最終反勝15:14晉級。余翠怡於八強再下一城，以15:10擊敗韓國代表，晉身四強，將會與另一名韓國劍手權曉京爭入決賽。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n由於賽事不設銅牌賽，余翠怡將肯定為港隊奪得獎牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:39:37.982249+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:12:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:18:00.984895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:37.708663+00:00","content_hash":"b29476ef512e6b8d0b0462dd66ac08aa1d325c231f984d321f69ea392eff834d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}